:44.72,0:02:47.18,Main,,0,0,0,,... to attend Mama's tea party!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:55.02,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror! Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.75,0:02:59.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You're welcome!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:06.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Something big is enveloping Brook...Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.36,0:03:13.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No way...Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:19.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this...Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:26.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That place is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.20,0:03:31.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That room is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.31,0:03:40.93,Main,,0,0,0,,... our Mama's bedroom!Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:43.51,Main,,0,0,0,,One of the Four Emperors, Big Mom?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What should we do?Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, at least he's alive...Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:53.37,Main,,0,0,0,,– Brook... – I didn't expect him to be in a place like that.Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:59.34,Main,,0,0,0,,But, why is she sleeping with Brook cradled in her arms?Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,– He's passed out, too. – How in the world can he sleep?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Wake up, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:13.77,Main,,0,0,0,,No good. He doesn't hear you.Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.56,0:04:18.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama would never willingly allow you...Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:20.82,Main,,0,0,0,,... to take such a strange, bony creature!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:26.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I can make it so she loosens her grip on him.Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.80,0:04:29.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama! It's me, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:30.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Choo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.71,Main,,0,0,0,,– Help! – Choo!Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.71,0:04:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,– Cut it out! – Cover their mouths!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Did all of that wake Big Mom up?Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, good. She's still sleeping...Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:57.86,Main,,0,0,0,,She...Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:59.19,Main,,0,0,0,,She...Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:01.57,Main,,0,0,0,,She spotted us!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:12.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a fly.Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,No! What, what? What's wrong?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.96,0:05:29.01,Main,,0,0,0,,He woke up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:31.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook! Over here, over here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:33.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to us now!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:34.79,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:39.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a fly.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:42.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't go back to sleep!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:46.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Mama? Are we under attack?Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sleeping!Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.03,0:05:50.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:53.87,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are!Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:25.94,Main,,0,0,0,,They're so powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.13,Main,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed...Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:43.42,Main,,0,0,0,,... to save...Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.09,0:06:45.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook...Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:48.59,Main,,0,0,0,,From those monsters?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:05.23,Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't for you!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. There's somebody that I really want to give it to.Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:27.42,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:32.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmmm...Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Does it need more hair?Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmm, then, will this work?Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:39.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that'll work perfectly!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:41.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Where exactly did you find this stuff?Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:44.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I found it at the castle's execution grounds.Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,And some seaweed from the kitchen is a substitute for his afro.Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's done.Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:55.03,Main,,0,0,0,,– Oh! It looks just like Brook! – Definitely!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.45,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can switch him out with this thing...Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:01.29,Main,,0,0,0,,... she won't realize that we've taken Brook away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:08.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, if we place Brûlée  right on the mirror...Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,... we can come and go through it freely.Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:16.97,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Damn! I'll make them pay for this!Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:21.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I think it's all set now. Let's begin.Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:24.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The Brook Rescue Mission!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:31.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm gonna try!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:33.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.39,0:08:36.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! You can just count on me!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.02,0:09:10.65,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That was scary! Really scary!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,– Are you okay, Chobro? – Somebody else should try.Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try next.Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.18,Main,,0,0,0,,That's it!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.69,0:09:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook, Brook, wake up.Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:42.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook, wake up now.Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:44.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! The snot bubble's coming!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:55.61,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Did she notice...Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:58.28,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Staaare...Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's staring right at me...Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:09.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:11.09,Main,,0,0,0,,A stuffed bunny!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.84,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not gonna work!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.37,0:10:20.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just a stuffed bunny.Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:24.10,Main,,0,0,0,,What? That worked?Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.10,0:10:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Now's your chance, Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I'll do it this time...Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that fly still here?Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.95,0:10:45.84,Main,,0,0,0,,What an annoying fly!Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:57.90,Main,,0,0,0,,– That was scary! Really scary! – Yep, yep.Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:59.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we need someone else to try.Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:02.80,Main,,0,0,0,,How disappointing. I guess when it comes to things like this...Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.63,0:11:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I must be the one to do it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.08,0:11:18.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.32,0:11:19.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.62,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,She's rolling over!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:36.13,Main,,0,0,0,,That's good for us.Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom isn't holding him anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:40.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll try!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook, wake up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.77,0:11:53.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.27,0:12:01.24,Main,,0,0,0,,A ghost!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.37,0:12:05.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you still here?Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,You annoying fly!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:37.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:46.24,Main,,0,0,0,,That... That was close.Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:49.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The mission succeeded!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:54.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.83,0:12:58.10,Main,,0,0,0,,–This is great! – I'm so relieved!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.86,0:13:28.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:33.47,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It seems like he created quite a ruckus.Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.64,0:13:51.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This is it for him!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:58.65,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're currently holding Straw Hat Luffy and the Cat Burglar captive-nasu.Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.65,0:14:03.69,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,He fought against one of their  top officers all night to get this far!Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:05.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So his body is...Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:08.18,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.25,0:14:12.37,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,... you said you'd be waiting for me right here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:17.71,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Luffy?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:30.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.77,0:14:35.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Y...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:36.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Y...Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Y...Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.81,Main,,0,0,0,,You startled me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.61,Main,,0,0,0,,A...Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:42.94,Main,,0,0,0,,A...Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.94,0:14:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,A...Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:47.36,Main,,0,0,0,,And all of this happened!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.36,0:14:49.70,Main,,0,0,0,,No, you're the one who startled me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:52.91,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,A ghost!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:55.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You screamed at a very bad time!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.84,0:14:58.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:01.98,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, you're alive. That's all that matters.Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:05.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, I thought I was going to die!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:08.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I am dead...Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.96,0:15:19.09,Main,,0,0,0,,When I saw their heavy security, I should've realized that it would be impossible for us to get a copy of the Road Poneglyph.Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.72,0:15:23.90,Main,,0,0,0,,But I pushed it, and put your-gara's life in danger.Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Everything you did was for us!Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.91,0:15:40.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Like you said before, since we were infiltrating them as a two-man team, it was a golden opportunity.Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:44.59,Main,,0,0,0,,If we had attempted to steal Big Mom's Road Poneglyph at any other time...Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.84,0:15:49.05,Main,,0,0,0,,... there would've been no way to avoid an all-out pirate war!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:55.85,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why we had to try, even if the odds were stacked against us.Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.48,0:16:03.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Here are the rubbings.Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:09.32,Main,,0,0,0,,But, anyway, Pedro-san, I can't believe you got away safely, too.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubbing...?Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.36,0:16:11.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:18.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I was so desperate for ideas that I couldn't  come up with anything but that decoy plan...Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:22.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Brook! Don't tell me this is...Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Those are the Poneglyph rubbings.Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.19,0:16:28.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It was such a close call!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Just when I'd finished with the third sheet...Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.09,0:16:35.18,Main,,0,0,0,,... Big Mom herself burst into the room!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.98,0:16:42.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You actually got it?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:50.61,Main,,0,0,0,,You were against all those guards, and there was even a Sweet Commander there...Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:17:01.44,Main,,0,0,0,,and yet, you came out with Big Mom's Poneglyph, something that any of the other Emperors would kill to have?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:03.62,Main,,0,0,0,,You really...Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, yes.Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.67,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:16.64,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,He stole our Poneglyph?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:19.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.16,0:17:23.72,Main,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:25.44,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:32.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Even Big Mom's family members are not easily permitted access to the Treasure Repository.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You're really something!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:37.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, could I see your panties...Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.93,0:17:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,His bones got broken again!Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:44.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one of our goals out of the way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:48.25,Main,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is take Sanji and run!Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Neither of them are there?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:38.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:42.14,Captions,,0,0,0,,Mirro-WorldDialogue: 0,0:18:38.46,0:18:42.92,Main,,0,0,0,,– They passed by a while ago. – They're not here anymore.Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:44.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Not even in Sanji's room?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:47.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Correct, there's some weird guy sleeping in there.Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:50.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. I think I might know where they are.Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:54.57,Main,,0,0,0,,It's outside, and there are no mirrors there.Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,This morning, Luffy and Sanji-kun...Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:01.66,Main,,0,0,0,,... fought at this place.Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Sanji had a fight?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, why?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.83,0:19:17.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji has his position in the Vinsmoke Family.Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:20.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right.Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:23.85,Main,,0,0,0,,He must have had a very good reason to come here.Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:27.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think it'll be so easy to take him back!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:32.12,Main,,0,0,0,,But, if we want to retrieve him, we had better do it soon.Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:37.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you once the whole group was together, but I might as well tell you now.Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:41.32,Main,,0,0,0,,When that ceremony begins tomorrow...Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:43.87,Main,,0,0,0,,... it will be anything but ordinary!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.08,0:19:46.62,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys came here with Pekoms, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pekoms!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:57.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Is he all right? We got separated from him on our way here!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:57.80,Note,,0,0,0,,Turn backDialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:20:03.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's fine. But there was a conspiratorial plot....Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.20,0:20:05.76,Main,,0,0,0,,... that nearly succeeded in having him fed to some sharks.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.76,0:20:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,A plot?Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.18,0:20:11.42,Main,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't spotted him...Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:16.02,Main,,0,0,0,,... he would be dead now.Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:18.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:26.78,Captions,,0,0,0,,Guest Room Sixth Floor: BaumDialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:26.83,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Are you people...Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:29.08,Main,,0,0,0,,... monsters?Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,How pathetic. Barmaids shouldn't pass out from drinking.Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I wish they would've sent us that girl from Sanji's crew.Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.47,0:20:52.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! That girl named Nami, right?! I would've loved to have a nice, headstrong girl like her here.Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:56.48,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard that Big Mom has taken her prisoner.Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.48,0:20:59.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can negotiate a trade tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:11.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough drinking for tonight. We can have our real party tomorrow night!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.07,0:21:17.40,Main,,0,0,0,,With the backing of the Emperor, Big Mom...Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:21.05,Main,,0,0,0,,... Germa will once again rule the North Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:24.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We will soon get our revenge...Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.17,0:21:32.64,Main,,0,0,0,,... on the hateful countries of the North Blue who have insulted and scorned us.Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:36.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be the celebration!Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:48.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I suppose that failure and shame of the Vinsmokes turned out to have his uses after all.Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:53.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That's true! Sanji was our bait,  and we were able to catch a big fish using him!Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,When our enemies see Big Mom's flag  on Germa's fleet, they'll lose all desire to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.83,0:22:03.51,Main,,0,0,0,,We can conquer the seas  with greater power than ever before.Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:06.68,Main,,0,0,0,,We ought to thank Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank Sanji?Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.94,0:22:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,To our failure!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.73,0:22:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,To our beneficial punk!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:19.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Cheers!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.23,0:22:28.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let anyone come into contact with the Vinsmokes until tomorrow's tea party.Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:29.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Understood.Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:34.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Also, we already have guards stationed by the third-floor medical room where Reiju-sama is.Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:34.33,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside of the Vinsmoke Family Guest RoomDialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,– Don't lower your guard. – Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.54,0:22:41.22,Main,,0,0,0,,The Vinsmokes can't escape their fate.Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.22,0:22:43.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say that out loud!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.16,0:22:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:54.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:58.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:40.85,Captions,,0,0,0,,Outside of TownDialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:54.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Get packing, you low-class pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.28,0:24:30.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hanji...Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.65,0:24:43.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you to wait.Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:46.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I refuse!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.51,0:24:55.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Eat what you can.Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.86,0:24:59.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Food...Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I dropped it on my way here. It's been crushed and it got wet in the rain.Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.59,0:25:23.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It's just another one of my failures, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.94,0:25:46.65,Main,,0,0,0,,It's good!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.95,0:26:03.04,Main,,0,0,0,,This food's the best!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.79,0:26:08.00,Main,,0,0,0,,You put all of our favorites in here!Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I want them to taste this!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.93,0:26:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,So good!Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.76,0:26:20.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Yum! Yum!Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.94,0:26:22.56,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Liar!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was so good!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:32.36,Main,,0,0,0,,I nearly shriveled up there!Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.54,0:26:38.04,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're finished, then leave.Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.95,0:26:42.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What are talking about?! Come with us!Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.58,0:26:47.79,Main,,0,0,0,,First of all...Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I insulted the captain of my own ship, who  came all the way here to help me.Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.22,0:26:57.97,Main,,0,0,0,,And then I did my best to hurt him, even though he didn't fight back at all.Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.18,0:27:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That means... I cannot go back to the ship now.Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.33,0:27:11.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Second of all...Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.71,0:27:17.19,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn geezer who saved my life, along with the home where I grew up...Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:20.26,Main,,0,0,0,,... the seafaring restaurant Baratie...Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.26,0:27:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,... are both being held hostage in case I don't play along.Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.22,Main,,0,0,0,,That means...Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.22,0:27:31.46,Main,,0,0,0,,... I cannot escape from this wedding.Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.34,0:27:42.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Third of all...Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.73,0:27:47.08,Main,,0,0,0,,My evil biological family is walking into Big Mom's trap!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.14,0:27:51.27,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll all be killed in a matter of hours!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.62,0:28:02.24,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't try to run away, everything will work out just fine, Sanji.Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.95,0:28:12.46,Main,,0,0,0,,To my biological father,  older brothers, and my younger brother...Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.46,0:28:14.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation.Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:17.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I have nothing but resentment for those scumbags!Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.84,0:28:24.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're a failure who deserves to die!Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:28.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Don't ever admit that I'm your father...Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.30,0:28:33.36,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,... to even a single person!Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.36,0:28:36.67,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I do not want anyone to learn of my shame.Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.93,0:28:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,But I...Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.72,0:28:46.03,Main,,0,0,0,,... can't...Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.38,0:28:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,... turn my back on them!Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.18,0:29:16.73,Main,,0,0,0,,For those three reasons,  I can't go back with you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.11,0:29:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,If you understand, get lost.Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.52,0:30:36.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Tell me how...Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.65,0:30:38.19,Main,,0,0,0,,... you really feel!Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.42,0:30:55.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Let's eat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.04,0:30:57.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Just cook something, you fool!Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.40,0:31:00.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun, what are you gonna make today?Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.02,0:31:18.89,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Who stole all the food?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.65,0:31:21.81,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I knew it was you guys!Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.76,0:31:25.78,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As your punishment, no dinner!Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.51,0:31:51.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy... I...Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.64,0:31:55.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I want to go back...Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,... to the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.30,0:32:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,But I can't find the courage to run away!Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.33,0:32:23.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Once the ceremony begins, I know...Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.32,0:32:27.00,Main,,0,0,0,,... that I won't be able to stop any of it on my own!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.14,0:32:30.66,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't even consider...Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.56,0:32:34.98,Main,,0,0,0,,... those scumbags to be my family!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.61,0:32:40.77,Main,,0,0,0,,But I...Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.36,0:32:46.09,Main,,0,0,0,,... want to save their lives!Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.07,0:32:58.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, that's who you are.Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.48,0:33:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got us! Let's crash this wedding!Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 2,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 1,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 2,0:00:02.26,0:00:02.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 1,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 2,0:00:02.65,0:00:03.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 1,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 2,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 1,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.14,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 2,0:00:03.14,0:00:03.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,moDialogue: 2,0:00:03.44,0:00:04.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,moDialogue: 1,0:00:01.83,0:00:03.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:03.82,0:00:04.28,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 1,0:00:01.87,0:00:03.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 2,0:00:03.98,0:00:04.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,gaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.91,0:00:04.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 2,0:00:04.31,0:00:04.91,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,taDialogue: 1,0:00:01.95,0:00:04.61,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 2,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,kaDialogue: 1,0:00:01.99,0:00:04.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,naDialogue: 2,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.55,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,naDialogue: 1,0:00:02.03,0:00:05.25,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tteDialogue: 2,0:00:05.25,0:00:05.93,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tteDialogue: 1,0:00:05.15,0:00:05.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.65,0:00:05.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.19,0:00:05.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:05.65,0:00:06.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialo